  sfxVolume: 0.8
  speakerName: 
  storyText: "GROUND FLOOR \u2014 CANTEEN"
  narrativeBeats:
  - The cafeteria is eerily quiet. Dozens of exhausted refugees are slumped across the plastic tables or sleeping on the linoleum floor. The smell of thin, watery broth hangs heavy in the morning air.
  - At the serving line, a young woman in an apron is trying to scrape the bottom of a steel pot. She looks dead on her feet, her hair plastered to her forehead with sweat.
  - "The refugee nods weakly and shuffles away. When you approach, the young woman puts on a practiced, weary smile.\r\n    \r\n        The cafeteria is the loudest room in the sanctuary, filled with the echoing murmur of dozens of hungry, frightened people. The smell of boiled rice and thin, watery broth hangs heavy in the air."
  - The serving line stretches across the room. At the front, a young woman in an apron is frantically trying to distribute ladles of soup into plastic bowls. She looks exhausted.
  - The refugee mutters something under his breath and snatches the bowl. The volunteer exhales a shaky breath and looks down at the nearly empty steel pot. When you approach, the young woman puts on a practiced smile.
  - Sadie spots you walking into the cafeteria and offers a warm, genuine smile. The ration line is much shorter now, and the atmosphere in the room feels slightly less desperate.
  - She pushes a warm bowl of thick stew and a slice of bread across the counter toward you.
  - "[+40 STAMINA] [HUNGER RESTORED] Rest and eat.\r\n            \r\n        \r\n    \r\n        You have already eaten your hot ration meal for today. Your hunger is satisfied."
  - Sadie is still behind the counter, stressed and struggling to stretch the emergency food supplies. She glances at you, wiping her forehead with the back of her wrist.
  - "i.id === \"Canned Food\" || i.id === \"Energy Bar\" || i.id === \"Beef Jerky\")>>\r\n            \r\n                \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                     i.id === \"Canned Food\")>> i.id === \"Energy Bar\")>>\r\n                    \r\n                \r\n                [+15 HUMANITY] [+15 TRUST] Donate extra rations to the kitchen.\r\n            \r\n        \r\n         i.id === \"Bottled Water\" && i.qty >= 2)>>\r\n            \r\n                \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                \r\n                [FETCH QUEST COMPLETE] [+20 TRUST] Hand over the clean water.\r\n            \r\n        \r\n            \r\n                \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                \r\n                Offer to fetch clean water from the Pantry."
  - "Search the industrial storage room.\r\n            \r\n            \r\n                \r\n                    \r\n                    \r\n                \r\n                Return to the Canteen Junction."
  dialogueLines:
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Refugee
    side: 0
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 0}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: Is there anything left? We've been trapped in this school all night!
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Volunteer
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 55833d612415010b56cfac299e9050ef, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: I'm scraping the bottom of the barrel. I'm sorry. If the scouts bring in more today, we'll double the portions.
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Refugee
    side: 0
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 0}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: That's it? That's half a bowl! We left everything behind when the sirens started!
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Volunteer
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 55833d612415010b56cfac299e9050ef, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: I know, I know. I'm sorry. Please stay in line! One ration pack per family right now. If the scouts bring in more tomorrow, we'll double the portions.
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Volunteer
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 55833d612415010b56cfac299e9050ef, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: New arrival? You'll need to sign in with Sgt. Vance if you haven't already. If you're here for food, the line starts by the double doors. I promise I'm going as fast as I can. I'm Sadie, by the way.
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Sadie
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 55833d612415010b56cfac299e9050ef, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: Things are finally settling down. You have no idea how much those supplies helped. People get scared when they're hungry. You kept a lot of people from panicking.
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Sadie
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 55833d612415010b56cfac299e9050ef, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: I saved a proper portion for you. Sit down. Eat. You've earned it.
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Sadie
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 55833d612415010b56cfac299e9050ef, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: If you need rations, I'm almost out. The water pipes in the school stopped working, so I can't even thin out the broth anymore.
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  initialFloorItems: []
